        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikwenda kwoŋ Kristo m'ogur wi musalaba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutmera, munyo abino bongi win fonjo adieri pa Were m'opanere, akioro wac maboyo kodi rieko ma malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kendo akimito ŋeyo giman je kwoŋ win munyo fodi anitie gi win kwanyo woko Yesu Kristo, aka m'ogur wi musalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 18:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo munyo abino bongi win oyido meni oloyan kareno akirin ro lworo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka luwo paran gi mikwenda paran k'obedo i luwo ma rieko pa ji, t'inyutho kamaler meni pa Cuny Maleŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋey yeyo mewin, wokiri wothenere kwoŋ rieko pa dhano, to kwoŋ meni pa Were ayin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rieko pa Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kad'ameno, waluwo gi rieko ri joma jotegino i yeyo. To k'obedo rieko ma ndir me, kosa apa jodhum ma pama, ma jokidho rerok woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rieko ma wafonjo obedo rieko pa Were m'opanere, m'opan ri ji, ma Were oyido otieko yiko miyo wan wok con ma piny fodi k'ocwey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye kad'acel kwoŋ jodhum ma pama m'oyido oŋeyo rieko me. Bedi joŋeyi di jok'oguro Rwoth m'opoŋ gi dwoŋ kwoŋ musalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.64.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 64:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To paka ndiko waco ama:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Were onyutho wan nyaliŋliŋ me luwo i Cuny Maleŋ pere. Ato Cuny Maleŋ udo gimoro je, kada gimoro m'opanere kamadiny i Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ŋa ma diŋey paro pa dhano kwanyo woko cuny dhano won manitie i go? Meno bende apaka Cuny Maleŋ pa Were won am'oŋeyo paro pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakilimo cuny manyapiny, to walimo Cuny m'owok bongi Were, ma miyo waniaŋ kwoŋ gimoro je ma Were omiyo wan ma nono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno a wac ma waluwo; wakiluw wac ma rieko ma dhano am'ofonjo wan, to waluwo gima Cuny Maleŋ ama fonjo wan, aka watito adieri ma Cuny ri joma bende jonitie gi Cuny Maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ŋat'ongoye gi Cuny kinyal limo mic ma wok bongi Cuny Maleŋ pa Were, rupiri obedo rigo gimiŋo: Go kinyal niaŋ kwoŋe, kwoŋbedo dwoŋ mere niaŋere ri ŋata bende nigi Cuny Maleŋ pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋata nitie gi Cuny nyalo niaŋ kwoŋ gimoro je, aka ongoye ŋata niaŋ kwoŋ gima nikwoŋ go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 40:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato ndiko waco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
